flowchart TD
    Client[Client] --> API[FastAPI API]
    API --> Submit[POST /tasks]
    API --> Status[GET /tasks/task_id]
    API --> Events[GET /tasks/task_id/events]
    API --> Approval[POST /tasks/task_id/approval]

    Submit --> Executor[InProcessExecutor]
    Approval --> Executor

    Executor --> TaskStore[(PostgreSQL task and event store)]
    Executor -->|execution_backend=celery| Dispatcher[Celery dispatcher]
    Executor -->|execution_backend=in_process| LocalRun[Local asyncio task]

    Dispatcher --> Redis[(Redis broker/result backend)]
    Redis --> Worker[Celery worker]
    Worker --> TaskStore
    Worker --> Checkpoints[(PostgreSQL LangGraph checkpoints)]
    Worker --> Memory[Memory service]
    LocalRun --> Checkpoints
    LocalRun --> Memory

    Memory -->|memory_backend=chroma| Chroma[(ChromaDB)]
    Memory -->|memory_backend=fake| FakeMemory[Fake memory service]

    Worker --> Workflow[LangGraph workflow]
    LocalRun --> Workflow
    Workflow --> Planning[Supervisor planning]
    Planning --> Parallel{Independent subtasks}
    Parallel --> Research[Research specialist]
    Parallel --> Analysis[Analysis specialist]

    Research --> Registry[Tool registry]
    Registry --> Demo[Demo search tool]
    Registry --> MCP[Brave Search MCP tool]

    Research --> Review[Reviewer]
    Analysis --> Review
    Review --> Decision{Review decision}
    Decision -->|approved| Synthesis[Synthesizer]
    Decision -->|needs revision| Retry[Specialist retry]
    Retry --> Research
    Retry --> Analysis
    Decision -->|escalate| Escalated[Escalated task]

    Synthesis --> Final[Final answer]
    Final --> TaskStore
    Final --> Memory

    Review -->|requires approval| Interrupt[Human approval interrupt]
    Interrupt --> TaskStore
    Approval -->|queues resume_workflow| Redis
    Redis --> Worker

